<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n39621" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">purgātĭo</span></b> ,
			ōnis, f.
		id., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>a
				cleansing</i>, <i>purging.</i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<b>Lit.</b>: cloacarum, Trajan. ap. <i><span class="en">Plin. Ep.
				10, 41 <i>fin.</i></span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">menstrua,</span>”
				<i>the monthly courses of women</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					32, 10, 46, § 131</span></i>
			; so, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">feminarum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					20, 9, 34, § 86</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">20, 14, 53,
				§ 148</span></i>; <i><span class="en">24, 13, 72, § 116</span></i>; 30, 14, 44, § 129;
				<i><span class="en">Sen. Q. N. 3, 16</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">alvi,</span>”
				<i>a purging</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Cic.
					N. D. 3, 22, 57</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">also simply purgatio,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					Fam. 16, 10, 1</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Trop.</b>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>A.</b>
			<i>A religious purgation</i> or <i>purification from guilt</i>, <i>an
			expiation</i>, <i><span class="en">Plin. 15, 30, 40, § 135</span></i>;
				<i><span class="en">Vulg.
				Heb. 1, 3</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>B.</b>
			<i>An apology</i>, <i>justification</i>,
				<i><span class="en">Cic.
				Inv. 1, 11, 15</span></i>; <i><span class="en">2, 31, 94</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Ter. Heaut.
				4, 1, 12</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
